  "description": "This is a set of 12 Mint Green and Pink Christmas Digital Paper patterns, perfect for the holiday season.\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality. \nThis set includes minimalist patterns with trees, dots, snowflakes, stars and branches, as well as stripes and “Happy Holidays” lettering. \nThe light and darker mint green, with the coral pink colour palette is inspired by christmas candy and is perfect for the Holiday season and allows you to easily mix and match the patterns for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, christmas home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and more.\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (33 MB) and includes:\n• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels\n* 12 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n* 12 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing\n* BONUS 16 washi tapes in PNG and TIFF (both transparent background)\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For better results, use the JPEG or TIFF files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings\nThank you for stopping by!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This is a set of 12 Mint Green and Pink Christmas Digital Paper patterns, perfect for the holiday season.<br>\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality. </p>\n<p>This set includes minimalist patterns with trees, dots, snowflakes, stars and branches, as well as stripes and “Happy Holidays” lettering. </p>\n<p>The light and darker mint green, with the coral pink colour palette is inspired by christmas candy and is perfect for the Holiday season and allows you to easily mix and match the patterns for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, christmas home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and more.</p>\n<p>This product comes in 1 Zipped folder (33 MB) and includes:</p>\n<p>• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns<br>\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi<br>\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels</p>\n<p>* 12 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use<br>\n* 12 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing</p>\n<p>* BONUS 16 washi tapes in PNG and TIFF (both transparent background)</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:<br>\n• For better results, use the JPEG or TIFF files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use<br>\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings</p>\n<p>Thank you for stopping by!</p>",
